#
# Derived from README §Callers (libpdx-argv.ENH-011 audit, 2026-08-25):
# each entry was verified by grepping the tool's own src/ for calls into
# this library's exported symbols (parse_argv, parsed_args_reset,
# register_all, parse_from_schema_record, fill_doc_argv).
#
# When adding a consumer, append a new line here AND update README §Callers
# with the same information (this file is authoritative; README mirrors it
# in prose). Removing a consumer requires both this file and README to be
# updated in the same commit.
#
# Comments (# ...) and blank lines are ignored by any downstream tooling
# that consumes this file (e.g., pkg/deps.list validators).

